{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11110190","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11110190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018001:":{"text":"都给我仔细找","source_cn":"都给我仔细找","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C8C2C9C05F0E607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018002:":{"text":"还能用的东西全带回主营去！","source_cn":"还能用的东西全带回主营去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60253762F164EE65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018003:":{"text":"瞧瞧，弟兄们，有人来了","source_cn":"瞧瞧，弟兄们，有人来了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F322A8214FF18AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018004:":{"text":"瓦尔克，我们的老熟人……","source_cn":"瓦尔克，我们的老熟人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8407E7C217168C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111019001:1":{"text":"看看谁来了？咸水镇的大英雄，曾经刺杀流沙之爪首领的赏金猎人，瓦尔克！","source_cn":"看看谁来了？咸水镇的大英雄，曾经刺杀流沙之爪首领的赏金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE41679E8FE5E293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111019002:1":{"text":"哦——对不起，我忘了，那次刺杀行动失败了，对吧？你从弗兰克手下苟活，逃之夭夭。","source_cn":"哦——对不起，我忘了，那次刺杀行动失败了，对吧？你从弗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x407EEEBC986AB300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111019003:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111019004:1":{"text":"你的搭档。我还记得他。怀特？还是提亚特？","source_cn":"你的搭档。我还记得他。怀特？还是提亚特？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE125151B8492592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111019005:1":{"text":"奇怪的赏金猎人搭档，瓦尔克与提亚特，人类和蛮血，只要价格合适，没有完不成的任务……","source_cn":"奇怪的赏金猎人搭档，瓦尔克与提亚特，人类和蛮血，只要价...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7487CCE177FB6692","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1111019005":{"text":"奇怪的赏金猎人搭档，瓦尔克与提亚特，人类和蛮血，只要价格合适，没有完不成的任务……","source_cn":"奇怪的赏金猎人搭档，瓦尔克与提亚特，人类和蛮血，只要价格合适，没有完不成的任务……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7487CCE177FB6692","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111019006:1":{"text":"他叫怀亚特。","source_cn":"他叫怀亚特。","status":"matched